      "label": "The speaker 'me' is mapped onto the whispering man",
      "description": "The text 'me: (whispering) black people' explicitly identifies the whispering man in the visual as the speaker 'me'. The act of whispering is visually represented by the man cupping his mouth near the other person's ear, and the text overlays this action to assign the speaker's identity to him.",
