      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the whispering man, as explicitly indicated by the text overlay 'me: (whispering) black people'. The user identifies with the whisperer's role and action, using the deictic pronoun 'me' to anchor their identity onto the visual entity 'man_whispering'. This projection is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it frames the user as the one perpetuating the racist stereotype.",
